  "UAL123: gs_kt 180 * 1852 / 3600 = 92.6 m/s; altb_ft 2650 * 0.3048 = 807.72 m; vr_fpm -640 * 0.3048 / 60 = -3.2512 m/s; sq \"7700\" -> 7700; age_s 3 at now 100000 ms -> seen_ms 97000.",
  "Set 1 of case 1 arrives as 5 objects (n = 5); 2 survive; the nearer (N12345, 1 km) comes first."
 ],
