  {
   "description": "Two traffic lines and traffic_done: units converted (kt, ft, fpm), hex lower-cased and '~' dropped, callsign trimmed, squawk as string or number; an aircraft without age_s, one 70 s old and one with a bad hex are dropped; a log_get line in between is not ours; nearest first.",
